  <header class="title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Piet Mondrian &middot; 1930 &middot; De Stijl</p>
    <h1>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow</h1>
    <p class="lede">A large red square, two small blocks of colour, thick black lines on white. Also listed as <em>Composition II in Red, Blue, and Yellow</em>.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="red" aria-label="Year">
    <span class="big">1930</span>
    <small>Oil on canvas</small>
  </section>

